    </a>

    <a href="/services/opener-repair" class="core-services-card opener">
      <h3>Opener Repair & Installation</h3>
      <p>Motor running but door won't move? Remote stopped working? Grinding noises? We repair all major brands — LiftMaster, Chamberlain, Genie, Craftsman — or install new smart openers with Wi-Fi and app control. Especially useful for rural properties and rental homes where remote access matters.</p>
    </a>
<!--
    <a href="/services/new-door-installation" class="core-services-card installation">
